'''Glorious Madness''' is a continuous effect toggled by {{sl|Embrace Madness}}. 

==Effects==
Glorious Madness causes you to gain a Touch debuff every 2 seconds, chosen randomly from a pool of 4. Each debuff can stack up to 10 times, lasts for 20 seconds, and refreshes the duration of existing stacks of that type when gained.

* {{stl|Eroding Touch}}: You take 6% increased damage per stack. 
* {{stl|Paralysing Touch}}: You have 6% reduced [[action speed]] per stack.
* {{stl|Diluting Touch}}: You have 9% reduced [[flask charges]] gained and 9% reduced [[flask]] effect per stack.
* {{stl|Wasting Touch}}: You have 9% reduced [[life]] and [[energy shield]] [[recovery]] rate per stack.
** Note: recovery rate applies to recovery over time and does not affect instantaneous recovery such as life gain on hit.

The acquired stacks count as [[debuff]]s and are affected by debuff [[Expiration rate|expiry rate]], reducing the likelihood that stacks are refreshed.  

